Strengthens you with the presence of blood, increasing damage by 2% and heals you for 1% of your damage dealt.

@ext:Only one Presence may be active at a time.:ext@

@ext:Heals up to a maximum of 5% of your health per hit.:ext@

Sprays targets in front of you with acid, dealing 27 Nature damage and dealing an additional 3 Nature damage every 3 seconds. Reduces armor by 5% for 12 sec.

This ability is usable while shapeshifted.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

Summon a herd of stampeding animals from the wilds around you that deal Physical damage to your enemies over 6 sec. The animals run up to 30 yards in front of you.

Enemies struck by the stampede take increased damage from your pet by 5% for 15 sec. Stacks up to 4 times. Enemies struck also have their movement speed reduced by 50% for 3 sec.

@ext:Damage is increased by 50% if Bestial Wrath is active on your pet.:ext@

@ext:The cooldown of Stampede is reduced by the Longevity talent.:ext@

